    "description": {
      "value": "<p>Through strange rituals and fateful encounters, you discovered that you share a unique bond with the spirits of the dead and the damned. Your body is a vessel for these spirits, granting you foresight from beyond the veil. Yet their intentions are not always benign, and their gifts carry a haunting price.</p><p><strong>Ability Scores:</strong> Constitution, Intelligence, Wisdom</p><p><strong>Feat:</strong> A Dark Gift feat of your choice (@UUID[Compendium.compendium-owidyn.backgrounds-feats.Item.9UNJXujWE0F0ekYU]{Gathered Whispers} is recommended)</p><p><strong>Skill Proficiencies:</strong> Insight and Religion</p><p><strong>Tool Proficiency:</strong> <em>Choose one kind of</em> Gaming Set</p><p><strong>Equipment:</strong> <em>Choose A or B:</em> (A) @UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.equipment24.Item.phbwepDagger0000]{Dagger}, Gaming Set (same as above), @UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.equipment24.Item.phbagBasket00000]{Basket}, @UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.equipment24.Item.phbagBell0000000]{Bell}, 8 @UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.equipment24.Item.phbagCandle00000]{Candles}, @UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.equipment24.Item.phbagInk00000000]{Ink}, @UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.equipment24.Item.phbagInkPen00000]{Ink Pen}, @UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.equipment24.Item.phbagPaper000000]{Paper} (5 sheets), @UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.equipment24.Item.phbagTinderbox00]{Tinderbox}, @UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.equipment24.Item.phbagClothesTrav]{Traveler's Clothes}, 32 GP; or (B) 50 GP</p>",
      "chat": ""
    },
